   3.977621220683749*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"ca20d25d-557b-404d-b4c6-\
4ceb67250d68"],

Cell["\<\
In this report, four-step explicit Adams-Bashforth method is used as the \
predictor. The starting values are computed using Runge- Kutta method of \
order four. The approximation is then improved using the three-step implicit \
Adams-Moulton method as the corrector. This method is denoted as ABM4 in this \
report.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.977004686226495*^9, 3.977004755200342*^9}, {
  3.977004818787842*^9, 
  3.977004828077343*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"60137125-2a03-4051-94a0-\
64ef2d0c8bf2"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[StyleBox["The Computation of Logistic Equation Population using \
